Sarengrad is the second-largest city in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. [[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] has been living in the city. It is where the [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]] keep their headquarters.
